        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nThis is an intended behavior of [first searching only inside current line/selection](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e94945129780fa5b43447ecc0a4b0273892043e3/doc/mini-ai.txt#L424-L427) before searching in the whole neighborhood. See [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/790#issuecomment-2045602383) for a suggested workaround.\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate of #790, #392, #123, #116.",
